   "lines": [
    "Went on to New York",
    "to see our football team",
    "play Princeton. Jack",
    "Tebbets and Harry Chapin",
    "are going to stay with",
    "me till Monday when",
    "we will all return",
    "with Bamie & Conie",
    "who are going to spend",
    "a week at Chestnut",
    "Hill."
